  {
   "id": "dust-neon-215894@major-2023-06-07",
   "gameId": "dust-neon-215894",
   "displayName": "Major Update and Price Change!",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2023-06-07T17:13:53.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Major Update!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "In this latest update the team has really been working hard on getting more content into the game.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We added a new mission type, Radio Beacon, where the player needs to find a core to enable a radio beacon and then defend the beacon while a signal is being transmitted.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We also added the Challenge Arena where the player is put to the test to complete 3 chambers filled with traps and dangerous enemies.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "And if that wasn't enough we also added an entirely new weapon manufacturer called Red Glow, a laser type weapon that features significantly faster reloads than all other weapons!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Update List",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "FEATURE: All new Challenge Arena mission type",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "FEATURE: All new Robot Swarm mission type",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "FEATURE: All new Red Glow (laser) weapon manufacturer",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "FEATURE: All new boss rotation system once all bosses has been beaten 3 times",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "BALANCING: Tweaked prices in homebase",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "BALANCING: Increased max level to 45",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "BALANCING: The game now gives two skillpoints longer and one skillpoint at later ranks",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "BALANCING: Rebuy prices now cheaper",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "BALANCING: Price changes in base upgrades",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "BALANCING: Blocked some enemies from early biomes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "BALANCING: Made skill respec way cheaper",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "BALANCING: Made Franks mind blowers cheaper",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "BALANCING: Moved train heist missions to appear earlier in the game",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "BALANCING: Legendary now spawns in gun shop after death",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "BUG FIX: Fixed some re-roll bugs that removed earlier bought boosts",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "BUG FIX: Fixed buyback price error when they become to expensive",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
