  {
   "id": "dust-neon-215894@2",
   "gameId": "dust-neon-215894",
   "displayName": "Patch 2",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2023-03-30T23:21:31.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hey everyone!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We’ve been working away behind the scenes and are pushing out our second major patch update for PC. In this update, we've added a whole new mission called Bomb Defusal, where players are tasked with finding a bomb and defusing it before it blows up, all while fighting off hordes of robots. We also listened to the requests for controller/keyboard remapping and added that.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "There are a ton more fixes being reported, so keep those feature requests and bug reports coming and we'll get on them!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "FEATURE: Added controller remapping.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "FEATURE: Added Bomb Defusal mission type with all new levels and gameplay mode.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "IMPROVEMENT: Added an art pass polish to some old levels.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "IMPROVEMENT: Kill Target missions now have pointers when the player is close, making it easier to find them.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "IMPROVEMENT: Tweaked damaged made to boss 5.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "IMPROVEMENT: Fixed a bug where enemies could be required to reload when first seen.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "IMPROVEMENT: Added a new turret to some of the earlier biomes.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "IMPROVEMENT: Added dedicated inventory button for mobile.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "IMPROVEMENT: Improved options menu.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "PC now has screen resolution and window mode settings",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Bloom, lens dirt, and chromatic aberration can now be disabled if wanted.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added an auto-ready aim for controllers that automatically brings up the aim when the aim stick is used.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "IMPROVEMENT: Sabotage missions now have a fail-safe to further avoid blockers or confusion.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "IMPROVEMENT: Added a hold to Pickup & Scrap option to weapon popup.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "IMPROVEMENT: Lowered prices of upgrades, tonics, and weapons in home base.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "IMPROVEMENT: Lowered prices of unlocking chests and doors in early game out on missions.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "FIX: Resolved a bug where enemies could count as in cover when they weren’t, making them hard to hit.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "FIX: Rebalanced explosions to make them a bit more dangerous.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "FIX: Improved player movement to reduce the chance of getting stuck on navmesh corners.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "This update is live right now so go try it out! And if you have any requests or comments please let us know!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "David Marquardt Studios Team",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
